#. きっと、戦刃むくろの死体は、
#. <CLT 3>生物室<CLT>に隠されてたんだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Mukuro's body was probably kept hidden in the <CLT 3>bio\n"
"lab<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. せ、生物室って…５階の？
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "The b-bio lab...? You mean, on the 5th f-floor?"
msgstr ""

#. あの生物室は、<CLT 3>死体安置所<CLT>として使われてたんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right. It's actually set up for use as a\n"
"<CLT 3>morgue<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. あの場所だったら死体も隠せるし、
#. 保存だって、問題なかったはずだよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So it's the perfect place to hide a body, and it'd\n"
"keep the body preserved at the same time."
msgstr ""

#. では、あの死体は生物室から
#. 植物庭園まで運ばれて来たという事か…
msgctxt "0005 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then you're also saying the body was moved from the\n"
"bio lab to the garden..."
msgstr ""

#. うん、あの死体が運ばれてるのは間違いないよ。
#. そう思う<CLT 3>根拠<CLT>だって、あるんだ…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And I have no doubt that that's exactly what happened.\n"
"In fact, I have <CLT 3>proof<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 死体が生物室にあった事はわかったよ！
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, we get that the body was in the bio lab!"
msgstr ""

#. そこから死体が運ばれてるのは間違いないんでしょ？
#. 根拠ってなに？
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The body must've been moved from there, for sure, but\n"
"what's the proof?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 死体が生物室にあった事はわかったよ！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, we get that the body was in the bio lab!"
msgstr ""

#. そこから死体が運ばれてるのは間違いないんでしょ？
#. 根拠ってなに？
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"The body must've been moved from there, for sure, but\n"
"what's the proof?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>うーん…この証拠じゃないかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... This might not be what I need...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. こ、根拠があるんでしょ！？
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Y-You DO have evidence, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. こんなところでじらさないで…早くしなさいよッ！
#. どこまで鬼畜なの！？
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Don't leave us in s-suspense! How sadistic c-can you\n"
"be...?"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川っちも、どんだけなんだべ…
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "How masochistic can *you* be?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>あの死体が生物室から植物庭園まで運ばれている…
#. そう考えられる根拠は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The proof that shows the body was carried from the bio\n"
"lab to the garden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの死体が生物室から植物庭園まで運ばれている…
#. そう考えられる根拠は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The proof that shows the body was carried from the bio\n"
"lab to the garden...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生物室から植物庭園に移動している、
#. 例の物だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's something that made its way from the bio lab\n"
"to the garden...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの死体が、生物室から植物庭園まで運ばれたと
#. 考えられる根拠は…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What makes me so sure the body was carried from the\n"
"bio lab to the garden is..."
msgstr ""

#. 植物庭園にあった、
#. あの<CLT 3>ビニールシート<CLT>なんだ。
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...the <CLT 3>tarp<CLT> that we found in the garden."
msgstr ""

#. あれを、もう１度調べ直してる時に、
#. 気付いた事があったんだ。
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When I was checking it over again, I noticed\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. ビニールシートの端に押された、
#. <CLT 3>小さなスタンプ<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I noticed that some text had been <CLT 3>stamped<CLT> on one\n"
"corner of the tarp."
msgstr ""

#. あ！　<CLT 3>生物室<CLT>って書いてあるよ！
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Oh! It says <CLT 3>bio lab<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. こんなちっこいの…よく気付いたな…？
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Holy cow... How'd you notice that tiny little thing?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木のせせこましい性格が、
#. 吉と出たようだな。
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Makoto's nit-picky nature seems to have surfaced with\n"
"perfect timing..."
msgstr ""

#. …つまり、あのビニールシートは、
#. 元は生物室にあった物なんだよ。
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This proves that the tarp originally came from the bio\n"
"lab."
msgstr ""

#. 実際、生物室には同じようなビニールシートが
#. 山積みになってたしね…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In fact, there's a whole stack of tarps just like it\n"
"in there."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、犯人は生物室の死体を、植物庭園に運ぶ際、
#. あのビニールシートに包んだ状態で運んだのよ。
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So when the killer moved the body to the garden, they\n"
"must have grabbed a tarp to wrap it in."
msgstr ""

#. そして、そのままスプリンクラーをやり過ごし、
#. その後で、例の白衣を着せたのね…
msgctxt "0032 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Then they simply left it as it was to protect against\n"
"the sprinklers, and put the coat on it afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. み、見事に…つじつまが合うじゃない…！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wow...you m-made everything sound so amazingly\n"
"c-consistent!"
msgstr ""

#. で、でも、そんなのってさ、
#. ただの推測じゃん！！
msgctxt "0034 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "B-But that's just a wild guess!"
msgstr ""

#. 死体をビニールシートで包んで運んだなんて、
#. その証拠は、どこにあるのさっ！？
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Where's your evidence!? Prove that the body was\n"
"wrapped in a tarp and moved!"
msgstr ""

#. 証拠はないわ。
#. 私は自分の推測を話しただけだもの。
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There is no evidence. I was simply explaining what I\n"
"think happened."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに…
#. あなたは随分、ムキになってるのね？
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But you seem to be getting pretty worked up about it,\n"
"wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

#. …ムキッ！？
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...Worked up!?"
msgstr ""

#. わかっているわ。話が生物室に及んで、
#. 内心穏やかじゃないんでしょう？
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Now that the conversation has turned to the topic of\n"
"the bio lab, you must be getting pretty nervous."
msgstr ""

#. だって、あの生物室にこそ、
#. あなたの<CLT 3>正体を暴く鍵<CLT>が、隠されているんだものね？
msgctxt "0040 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because the <CLT 3>key to uncovering your secret identity<CLT>\n"
"is hidden within that room, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. …黒幕の正体を暴く鍵！？
msgctxt "0041 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Are you talking about unmasking the mastermind!?"
msgstr ""

#. あの生物室には、ある<CLT 3>矛盾点<CLT>があったわ。
#. とても見過ごす事の出来ない大きな矛盾点がね…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You see, the bio lab contained an <CLT 3>inconsistency<CLT>—one\n"
"so major it can't be overlooked."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>生物室にあった矛盾点…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>An inconsistency in the bio lab...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could you be talking about...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あー、あー、あー！
#. 聞こえない！　聞こえないよー！
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "La-la-la! I can't hear you! La-la-la!"
msgstr ""

#. …幼稚な妨害ね。無視して続けましょう。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Such a child... Oh well, just ignore him."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…気を取り直して…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hrmm... I need to pull myself together and think...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが言ってた<CLT><CLT 3>“生物室の矛盾点”<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. もしかして、それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The <CLT><CLT 3>inconsistency in the bio lab<CLT><CLT 4>... Could you be\n"
"talking about—?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ところで、苗木クン！
#. 例の件についてはどう思う？
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hey, by the way, Makoto! What about that one thing!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. なんだよ…例の件って…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...one thing?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…そりゃもちろん…
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... What do you think? I'm talking about..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木クンのご家族の件だよ。
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "...your family."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…え！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…忘れた訳じゃないよね？
#. あのビデオメッセージの事をさ！
msgctxt "0055 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Puhuhuhu! Don't tell me you forgot about that video\n"
"message!"
msgstr ""

#. あれって、なんだったのかね？
#. 結局、ご家族は無事なんですかね？
msgctxt "0056 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So what do you think? Are you sure your family's still\n"
"okay?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで…ッ！　今更、そんな事…！
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh—!? Why are you bringing that up now!?"
msgstr ""

#. お父さん、お母さん、妹さん…
#. 苗木家のご家族に何があったのでしょうかー！？
msgctxt "0058 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Your mom, your dad, your little sister... What do you\n"
"think has happened to your family?"
msgstr ""

#. 果たして、彼らは無事なのでしょうかー！？
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Are they really as safe as you might have assumed?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いい加減にしろよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Stop talking about that!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、落ち着いて。
#. あなたを惑わそうとしているだけよ。
msgctxt "0061 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Calm down, Makoto. He wants you to get upset."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>そ、そうだ…落ち着かないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...I need to calm down.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつなんかに…惑わされちゃ駄目だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let him get to me...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつは、生物室の矛盾点を指摘されたくないから、
#. あんな風にジャマをしているだけなんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He's just saying that cuz he knows we're getting close\n"
"to the truth of the bio lab!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…あいつを黙らせる為には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So if I want to shut him up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その矛盾点を明らかにして、
#. それを、ぶつけるしかない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I need to expose the inconsistency and slam him\n"
"with it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、そうだ…落ち着かないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...I need to calm down.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつなんかに…惑わされちゃ駄目だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let him get to me...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつは、生物室の矛盾点を指摘されたくないから、
#. あんな風にジャマをしているだけなんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He's just saying that cuz he knows we're getting close\n"
"to the truth of the bio lab!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…あいつを黙らせる為には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So if I want to shut him up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その矛盾点を明らかにして、
#. それを、ぶつけるしかない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I need to expose the inconsistency and slam him\n"
"with it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>矛盾点…それはきっと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The inconsistency has to be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>数が合わなかった例の物の事だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...that one area where the numbers just don't match\n"
"up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
